# PolyKernel Todo 9 (Wave 2): CUDA GELU/SiLU kernels + CPU reference — QA log
# Extends the Todo 8 framework (RMSNorm). Deliverables: gelu.cu + silu.cu CUDA
# kernels (portable template), --lower-to-cuda gelu/silu emitters, launch_gelu_cpu
# + launch_silu_cpu CPU refs + drivers, CPU-ref-vs-golden tests. RMSNorm re-confirmed.
# ROUNDING CONTRACT: bf16 (RNE) in, fp32 compute, bf16 out (matches golden.py).
# GELU = 0.5*x*(1+erf(x/sqrt(2))) [exact erf, NOT tanh approx]; SiLU = x/(1+exp(-x)).
